{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10351","headline":"送萧十八与房侍御廻还 · 高适","name":"送萧十八与房侍御廻还","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常苦古人远，今见斯人古。\n澹泊遗声华，周旋必邹鲁。\n故交在梁宋，游方出庭户。\n匹马鸣朔风，一身济河浒。\n辛勤采兰咏，款曲翰林主。\n岁月催别离，庭围远风土。\n寥寥寒烟静，莽莽夕阴吐。\n明发不在兹，青天眇难覩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10351.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10351","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}